    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Touch a creature and pick an ability. On a failed CON save it takes 11d8 Necrotic damage and is Poisoned, with Disadvantage on saves using that ability. At the end of each of its turns it saves again (rolled and counted automatically): three successes end the spell, three failures make it last 7 days.</p>",
